"""

node u subtree k edges, selected kids S, not selected NS:

dp_k(u) = sum {kid v from S, dp_k1(v) + w_u_v} + sum {kid v from NS, dp_k(v)}

insert greedy

if S full -> delete from S one with the smallest dp_k1(v) + w_u_v - dp_k(v)

